Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository.
The data produced by this study (generated ODPs in outputs/, evaluation
results, annotations and the pseudonymised questionnaire exports) are made
available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Third-party material keeps its original licence: the reference ODPs in
data/ground_truth/ and data/ontologies_retrived/, and the scenarios and
competency questions quoted from the source papers listed in data/odp.csv.
